  "label": "Anti-Black Racism Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black women are inherently criminal or deceptive, particularly in relation to immigration status. This is a form of racialized gendered hate that falsely accuses a Black woman of committing fraud to gain citizenship or residency, which is a common trope in anti-Black racism. The meme uses this stereotype to delegitimize her and incite hostility.",
